WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,520
Where is the beauty boss Shaoyang? Where is that boy? I don’t know.

2
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,200
You just kept pulling on my rope

3
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,000
I thought you were in trouble, so I ran back

4
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:23,740
Do you believe there are ghosts in this world? I do. Why don’t you believe it?

5
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,900
Captain Beauty, you don’t need anyone to protect you

6
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,140
You will be scared when you see ghosts

7
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:42,700
Is it my son?

8
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,440
What the boy said is true
